    previousLimit: 'Pixel-space masked reconstruction spent loss on textures and exact colors even when those details were irrelevant downstream.',
    dataPreparation: 'Sample a large context block and separate target blocks, encode the full image with a slowly updated target encoder, and hide targets from the context encoder. Example row: image 17, context patches {1…10}, target patches {12,15}.',
